# LeakSanitizer suppressions for the Linux CI gate (testing/ci_linux.sh).
#
# Every entry is a DELIBERATE process-lifetime allocation listed in the P2.3
# audit table (claude-workspace/plans/2026-07-04-phase2-ownership-registry.md,
# Task 3 Step 2) and carries a matching comment in the code. Nothing else may
# be added here without a row in that table.
#
# Helpers constructed inside component constructors, not by the parser:
leak:emili::EmptyLocalSearch::EmptyLocalSearch
leak:emili::GVNS::GVNS
leak:emili::AlternateLocalSearch::AlternateLocalSearch
leak:emili::pfsp::GVNS_innerloop::GVNS_innerloop
# The globalBest singleton allocated when the parser registers the root:
leak:emili::setRootAlgorithm
# Windows-only NOSIG path: the replaced TimedTermination (never runs on Linux,
# listed for completeness):
leak:emili::LocalSearch::setSearchTime
